From 20c854a5e1ee541bab4f3611de54cc7bd347ed62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 04:20:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 28/58] envs, tests: register the fork's knobs by cache
 identity; lint; gpu test marker

- Every fork knob is registered in envs.py and classified as a compile/capture
  factor or runtime-only; envs.py documents that capture identity and AOT
  cache identity are different things.
- ruff findings cleared on lines this fork authored; upstream lines untouched.
- A `gpu` pytest marker so the GPU-free tier can be selected, not just skipped.
- Duplicate knob-table entries from two branches reconciled onto one
  off|warn|raise normaliser.
