+"""v2 reader fix: the instrumentation readers must never wait on
+the compute stream.
+
+The earlier cadence reader did a synchronous pageable ``tolist()`` from its thread;
+the driver held the CUDA context lock while that copy waited for the stream,
+and a pending PLE pull-transport wait on the stream (whose producer needs the
+same lock) deadlocked the worker. These tests park a kernel on the current
+(compute) stream and require a reader tick to return while it is still running.
+On the pre-fix reader the first GPU test blocks for the kernel's duration.
 """
